    "Higher supersampling renders glyphs above final resolution, then downsamples them for cleaner tiny shapes.": "更高的超级采样会先以高于最终分辨率的尺寸渲染字形，再缩小，从而让微小形状更干净。",
    "Transparent ASCII background keeps alpha in transparency-capable exports.": "透明 ASCII 背景会在支持透明度的导出格式中保留 Alpha。",
    "Adds unique characters to the selected built-in set without replacing it.": "将唯一字符添加到所选内置字符集，而不会替换它。",
    "Glyph size relative to the cell. 1.00× is roughly one cell high; the cell grid and spacing do not change.": "字形相对于单元格的尺寸。1.00× 大约等于一个单元格高；单元格网格和间距不会改变。",
    "How strongly High Detail cares about the spatial shape inside each cell.": "高细节模式对每个单元格内部空间形状的重视程度。",
